{"title":"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A quadratic equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/f/a0f7e139ac19956348be49ad256dd119a0f64f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + ax + b + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" /> with integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> has roots which are positive integers. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d3200f508f2bf0ee872dcc13ec904170623dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" /> is not a prime.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the two positive roots of the quadratic.  By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/a/bfab72ef6f534f3349cfc4fffb5dda6cf0788032.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r + s = -a\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/5/035e958f71f0353126c2e1a8b4947c27e433175a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[rs-1 = b\\]\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />\nSquare both equations to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae9b4178f30404d9353c748b3457321bbffe343.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r^2 + 2rs + s^2 = a^2\\]\" width=\"142\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/e/43ecfbf18e4b1dda7e1c6be55131706cb9530ff0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r^2s^2 - 2rs + 1 = b^2\\]\" width=\"150\" height=\"16\" />\nAdd the two equations to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/7/a476413f955eb53cb39f1caa437302bfc5ad48f8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2 + b^2 = r^2 + 2rs + s^2 + r^2s^2 - 2rs + 1\\]\" width=\"314\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9fbb30c0c023cb7f1fc1f737c5d4c0f9a3f5f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2 + b^2 = r^2 + s^2 + r^2s^2 + 1\\]\" width=\"217\" height=\"16\" />\nThe right hand side can be factored into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/5/4e5553cc99efa8f083df64808f93b594b6d3d564.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r^2 + 1)(s^2 + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"19\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/7/727bdbad766835968d5b01bc71015cc34be8664b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r,s &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/1/7a1d03803e97be7b847aa6422c4c7e42357c3c59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2 + 1 &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/9/ae9234cc4b598f3789a641412e68fd7245782c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s^2 + 1 &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d3200f508f2bf0ee872dcc13ec904170623dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" /> can never be a prime since it can be written as the product of two integers greater than one.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO\">2004 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016220140\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 124/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1044/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3015/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.668      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    6.668      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16558:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016220140 and revision id 96557. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}